[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":28},["ShallowReactive",2],{"useQiitaArticleDetailFetcher":3,"useQiitaAuthorizedUser":26},{"rendered_body":4,"body":5,"coediting":6,"comments_count":7,"created_at":8,"group":9,"id":10,"likes_count":7,"private":6,"reactions_count":7,"stocks_count":7,"tags":11,"title":15,"updated_at":16,"url":17,"user":18,"page_views_count":25,"team_membership":9,"organization_url_name":9,"slide":6},"\u003Ch1 data-sourcepos=\"1:1-1:14\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"はじめに\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#%E3%81%AF%E3%81%98%E3%82%81%E3%81%AB\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>はじめに\u003C/h1>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:132\">デザインの知見がまったくないので今月からちょっとずつ勉強を始めたいなと思ってやっている。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"5:1-6:27\">ランダムに配色を提案してくれる系のサイトは本当に好き\u003Cbr>\n見てるだけで楽しい\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:147\">そこで、今まで勉強で使ってみたサイトとこれから使いたいとと思っている配色系のサイトをまとめておく。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"10:1-10:12\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"colorable\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#colorable\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>Colorable\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"12:1-12:29\">\u003Ciframe id=\"qiita-embed-content__99213860adca41650b83c81d1a234de6\" src=\"https://qiita.com/embed-contents/link-card#qiita-embed-content__99213860adca41650b83c81d1a234de6\" data-content=\"https%3A%2F%2Fcolorable.jxnblk.com%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;\" height=\"29\">\n\u003C/iframe>\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"14:1-14:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F75622582-acf2-0db9-4c5b-b37256867791.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=af81cc619dc6be14853f651f21c5f583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F75622582-acf2-0db9-4c5b-b37256867791.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=af81cc619dc6be14853f651f21c5f583\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F75622582-acf2-0db9-4c5b-b37256867791.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=2e0ce7acd9f79d1504ee2ff257a68733 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/75622582-acf2-0db9-4c5b-b37256867791.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul data-sourcepos=\"16:1-21:0\">\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"16:1-16:55\">Aaの部分が見やすさの評価になっている\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"17:1-17:74\">Randomボタンを押すとランダムに配色を提案してくれる\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"18:1-18:75\">Textの下のバーを調節するとテキストの色を調整できる\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"19:1-21:0\">Backgroundを調整すると背景色を調整できる\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"22:1-23:60\">テキストと背景を調整することでコントラストを確認できる\u003Cbr>\nコントラストの評価が低いと数値が低くなる\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"26:1-26:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F188bea3a-aff7-5865-eb69-517e5dff22ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=00f0dc96b892d22495ebd6aeba0fc47b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F188bea3a-aff7-5865-eb69-517e5dff22ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=00f0dc96b892d22495ebd6aeba0fc47b\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F188bea3a-aff7-5865-eb69-517e5dff22ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=f08ac2bf6d21802b17d8f265d357b735 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/188bea3a-aff7-5865-eb69-517e5dff22ee.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"28:1-29:76\">例えばこれは \u003Ccode>1.34Fail\u003C/code>と表示される\u003Cbr>\n逆に1枚目の写真は見やすいので\u003Ccode>7.84AAA\u003C/code>と表示されている\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"31:1-31:80\">配色や見やすさ大丈夫かな？という確認に使えそう(V)o￥o(V)\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"34:1-34:13\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"randoma11y\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#randoma11y\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>RandomA11y\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"36:1-36:23\">\u003Ciframe id=\"qiita-embed-content__ba4b2ea0c1ce6a5c2f8b05812b5b8ae5\" src=\"https://qiita.com/embed-contents/link-card#qiita-embed-content__ba4b2ea0c1ce6a5c2f8b05812b5b8ae5\" data-content=\"https%3A%2F%2Frandoma11y.com%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;\" height=\"29\">\n\u003C/iframe>\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"38:1-38:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fc31856ee-7111-cafb-5336-1edc24e85fc7.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=e07bef67266b3114feca7982a59e4bb9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fc31856ee-7111-cafb-5336-1edc24e85fc7.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=e07bef67266b3114feca7982a59e4bb9\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fc31856ee-7111-cafb-5336-1edc24e85fc7.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=15a5157b8d81a5b84df524e05a87faa7 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/c31856ee-7111-cafb-5336-1edc24e85fc7.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"41:1-42:51\">名前の通りアクセシビリティを考慮した配色をランダムで提案してくれる\u003Cbr>\nこれはもう見た目がかっこよくて好き\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"44:1-44:96\">グラフが表示されていたりするので、プレゼン資料の参考になりそう。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cul data-sourcepos=\"47:1-50:0\">\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"47:1-47:73\">右上のGenerate→ボタンを押すとランダムで表示される\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli data-sourcepos=\"48:1-50:0\">Pinned colorに設定したカラーを基準に配色をランダムで提案してくれる\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ul>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"51:1-52:48\">Pinned colorを\u003Ccode>#000\u003Cspan class=\"inline-code-color\" style=\"background-color: #000;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/code>にしてみた\u003Cbr>\n黒をベースに何色か提案してくれる\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"54:1-54:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fcd3771b3-636a-fb12-abe1-ae1c1f199f5a.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=4570a14698cac6be2854930730ae0c8e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fcd3771b3-636a-fb12-abe1-ae1c1f199f5a.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=4570a14698cac6be2854930730ae0c8e\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fcd3771b3-636a-fb12-abe1-ae1c1f199f5a.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=8d27798258d262ae293238148c4543e6 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/cd3771b3-636a-fb12-abe1-ae1c1f199f5a.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"56:1-56:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F88a15a73-65eb-8720-2826-c8b98ecd99ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=23bc488bb8f9fb179dcb563135c59580\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F88a15a73-65eb-8720-2826-c8b98ecd99ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=23bc488bb8f9fb179dcb563135c59580\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F88a15a73-65eb-8720-2826-c8b98ecd99ee.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=bc089f951c0ec916f25ce4ff5b16825d 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/88a15a73-65eb-8720-2826-c8b98ecd99ee.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"58:1-58:10\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"pigment\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#pigment\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>Pigment\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"60:1-60:32\">\u003Ciframe id=\"qiita-embed-content__5e35b04a574b0ddd9200aa6f5b1b87aa\" src=\"https://qiita.com/embed-contents/link-card#qiita-embed-content__5e35b04a574b0ddd9200aa6f5b1b87aa\" data-content=\"https%3A%2F%2Fpigment.shapefactory.co%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;\" height=\"29\">\n\u003C/iframe>\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"62:1-62:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F92e844d3-f6cd-740d-a9f5-a4c849a77975.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=257f0b885ead6910664de25fae8d9a77\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F92e844d3-f6cd-740d-a9f5-a4c849a77975.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=257f0b885ead6910664de25fae8d9a77\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F92e844d3-f6cd-740d-a9f5-a4c849a77975.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=0db7a97506e959b3a55cbc3c0f13c242 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/92e844d3-f6cd-740d-a9f5-a4c849a77975.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"64:1-64:60\">これまた見ているだけで楽しいやつ・・・！\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"66:1-66:117\">カラーコードをクリックするとコピーできて、そのままサイトデザインに反映できる。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"68:1-68:9\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"colors\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#colors\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>Colors\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"70:1-70:19\">\u003Ciframe id=\"qiita-embed-content__998acee958587f7d854c5fa07a09d9fe\" src=\"https://qiita.com/embed-contents/link-card#qiita-embed-content__998acee958587f7d854c5fa07a09d9fe\" data-content=\"https%3A%2F%2Fcoolors.co%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;\" height=\"29\">\n\u003C/iframe>\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"72:1-72:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fecca822d-d54d-e6e5-852a-d0dc0bf1007b.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=a61e7f92e9bef111fcd550c44623af81\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fecca822d-d54d-e6e5-852a-d0dc0bf1007b.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=a61e7f92e9bef111fcd550c44623af81\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Fecca822d-d54d-e6e5-852a-d0dc0bf1007b.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=2a647fe4c9a3a55bb1c16aa7f86ad432 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/ecca822d-d54d-e6e5-852a-d0dc0bf1007b.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"74:1-74:58\">5色の組み合わせを試してみることができる\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"76:1-76:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F0ae5725f-1e3d-3b51-0e1f-6ff439b470fb.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=0ad2342b689a7616e7a458414ece6771\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F0ae5725f-1e3d-3b51-0e1f-6ff439b470fb.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=0ad2342b689a7616e7a458414ece6771\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F0ae5725f-1e3d-3b51-0e1f-6ff439b470fb.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=4b989066e9834535bd021f3efa097779 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/0ae5725f-1e3d-3b51-0e1f-6ff439b470fb.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"78:1-78:111\">クリックすると近しい色を選択でき、簡単にグラデーションを試すことができる。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"80:1-80:13\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"colorspace\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#colorspace\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>ColorSpace\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"82:1-82:22\">\u003Ciframe id=\"qiita-embed-content__d980bc95005f5e73f9ec25d21e9e506c\" src=\"https://qiita.com/embed-contents/link-card#qiita-embed-content__d980bc95005f5e73f9ec25d21e9e506c\" data-content=\"https%3A%2F%2Fmycolor.space%2F\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;\" height=\"29\">\n\u003C/iframe>\n\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"84:1-84:64\">1色選択するとランダムに配色を提案してくれる\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"86:1-86:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F2d615bf3-2d97-02b0-e40a-6fde131c43d3.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=82a1c9ece16cc042da158b950c946b99\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F2d615bf3-2d97-02b0-e40a-6fde131c43d3.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=82a1c9ece16cc042da158b950c946b99\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F2d615bf3-2d97-02b0-e40a-6fde131c43d3.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=7ef29f3b605222ec0095afa4864f7fca 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/2d615bf3-2d97-02b0-e40a-6fde131c43d3.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"88:1-88:42\">\u003Ccode>#235B75\u003Cspan class=\"inline-code-color\" style=\"background-color: #235B75;\">\u003C/span>\u003C/code>を選択して生成してみた\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"91:1-91:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Face19813-f3b5-c7c9-d0f7-fdc0dea553f0.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=be7f4d33f6236d5eeb1566e82e853d53\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Face19813-f3b5-c7c9-d0f7-fdc0dea553f0.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=be7f4d33f6236d5eeb1566e82e853d53\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2Face19813-f3b5-c7c9-d0f7-fdc0dea553f0.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=198fc1e95ab28ba8b41cd88f8f91bc73 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/ace19813-f3b5-c7c9-d0f7-fdc0dea553f0.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"93:1-93:162\">他にもドットを描くときにおすすめな\u003Ccode>Dotting Palette\u003C/code>とか親しみのある\u003Ccode>Friend palette\u003C/code>とかが、いろんなテーマで生成される。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"95:1-95:121\">\u003Ca href=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F9c3cd902-bd9e-50d5-5d9b-f675ebc5ad77.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=fe20a3aae617f7a1a80a0874276c8333\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">\u003Cimg src=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F9c3cd902-bd9e-50d5-5d9b-f675ebc5ad77.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;s=fe20a3aae617f7a1a80a0874276c8333\" alt=\"image.png\" srcset=\"https://qiita-user-contents.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fqiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com%2F0%2F667288%2F9c3cd902-bd9e-50d5-5d9b-f675ebc5ad77.png?ixlib=rb-4.0.0&amp;auto=format&amp;gif-q=60&amp;q=75&amp;w=1400&amp;fit=max&amp;s=373f893a650c4661f1cd83f8eea4009f 1x\" data-canonical-src=\"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/9c3cd902-bd9e-50d5-5d9b-f675ebc5ad77.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\u003C/a>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"97:1-97:106\">なんかWebデザインだけでなく、ネイルとかの配色の参考にもなりそうな感じ👀\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 data-sourcepos=\"99:1-99:15\">\n\u003Cspan id=\"さいごに\" class=\"fragment\">\u003C/span>\u003Ca href=\"#%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%81%94%E3%81%AB\">\u003Ci class=\"fa fa-link\">\u003C/i>\u003C/a>さいごに\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp data-sourcepos=\"100:1-100:165\">今月からデザインに触れ始めて配色とかデザインは本当に難しいと感じたので、こういう便利なツールに頼れるのはよい。\u003C/p>\n","# はじめに\n\nデザインの知見がまったくないので今月からちょっとずつ勉強を始めたいなと思ってやっている。\n\nランダムに配色を提案してくれる系のサイトは本当に好き\n見てるだけで楽しい\n\nそこで、今まで勉強で使ってみたサイトとこれから使いたいとと思っている配色系のサイトをまとめておく。\n\n## Colorable\n\nhttps://colorable.jxnblk.com/\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/75622582-acf2-0db9-4c5b-b37256867791.png)\n\n- Aaの部分が見やすさの評価になっている\n- Randomボタンを押すとランダムに配色を提案してくれる\n- Textの下のバーを調節するとテキストの色を調整できる\n- Backgroundを調整すると背景色を調整できる\n\n\nテキストと背景を調整することでコントラストを確認できる\nコントラストの評価が低いと数値が低くなる\n\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/188bea3a-aff7-5865-eb69-517e5dff22ee.png)\n\n例えばこれは `1.34Fail`と表示される\n逆に1枚目の写真は見やすいので`7.84AAA`と表示されている\n\n配色や見やすさ大丈夫かな？という確認に使えそう(V)o￥o(V)\n\n\n## RandomA11y\n\nhttps://randoma11y.com/\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/c31856ee-7111-cafb-5336-1edc24e85fc7.png)\n\n\n名前の通りアクセシビリティを考慮した配色をランダムで提案してくれる\nこれはもう見た目がかっこよくて好き\n\nグラフが表示されていたりするので、プレゼン資料の参考になりそう。\n\n\n- 右上のGenerate→ボタンを押すとランダムで表示される\n- Pinned colorに設定したカラーを基準に配色をランダムで提案してくれる\n\n\nPinned colorを`#000`にしてみた\n黒をベースに何色か提案してくれる\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/cd3771b3-636a-fb12-abe1-ae1c1f199f5a.png)\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/88a15a73-65eb-8720-2826-c8b98ecd99ee.png)\n\n## Pigment\n\nhttps://pigment.shapefactory.co/\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/92e844d3-f6cd-740d-a9f5-a4c849a77975.png)\n\nこれまた見ているだけで楽しいやつ・・・！\n\nカラーコードをクリックするとコピーできて、そのままサイトデザインに反映できる。\n\n## Colors\n\nhttps://coolors.co/\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/ecca822d-d54d-e6e5-852a-d0dc0bf1007b.png)\n\n5色の組み合わせを試してみることができる\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/0ae5725f-1e3d-3b51-0e1f-6ff439b470fb.png)\n\nクリックすると近しい色を選択でき、簡単にグラデーションを試すことができる。\n\n## ColorSpace\n\nhttps://mycolor.space/\n\n1色選択するとランダムに配色を提案してくれる\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/2d615bf3-2d97-02b0-e40a-6fde131c43d3.png)\n\n`#235B75`を選択して生成してみた\n\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/ace19813-f3b5-c7c9-d0f7-fdc0dea553f0.png)\n\n他にもドットを描くときにおすすめな`Dotting Palette`とか親しみのある`Friend palette`とかが、いろんなテーマで生成される。\n\n![image.png](https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/9c3cd902-bd9e-50d5-5d9b-f675ebc5ad77.png)\n\nなんかWebデザインだけでなく、ネイルとかの配色の参考にもなりそうな感じ👀\n\n## さいごに\n今月からデザインに触れ始めて配色とかデザインは本当に難しいと感じたので、こういう便利なツールに頼れるのはよい。\n",false,0,"2024-12-24T01:52:31+09:00",null,"1d4b35592aa6b0fa8304",[12],{"name":13,"versions":14},"Design",[],"【デザイン】配色系の参考リンクをまとめる","2024-12-24T01:53:09+09:00","https://qiita.com/chimrindayo/items/1d4b35592aa6b0fa8304",{"description":19,"facebook_id":19,"followees_count":7,"followers_count":7,"github_login_name":9,"id":20,"items_count":21,"linkedin_id":19,"location":19,"name":22,"organization":19,"permanent_id":23,"profile_image_url":24,"team_only":6,"twitter_screen_name":20,"website_url":19},"","chimrindayo",17,"chimrin",667288,"https://qiita-image-store.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/0/667288/profile-images/1731046053",128,{"description":19,"facebook_id":19,"followees_count":7,"followers_count":7,"github_login_name":9,"id":20,"items_count":21,"linkedin_id":19,"location":19,"name":22,"organization":19,"permanent_id":23,"profile_image_url":24,"team_only":6,"twitter_screen_name":20,"website_url":19,"image_monthly_upload_limit":27,"image_monthly_upload_remaining":27},104857600,1744278644745]